==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fossil|Slowbro|43}} from the {{TCG|Fossil}} expansion.
*'''Super Psy Bolt''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Super Psy''' on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Kadabra|32}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
**Super Psy Bolt's Japanese name is derived from that of {{m|Confusion}}, a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Slowbro}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

